    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875640/extras/493bf1ede58c2dbbd33c544c90c709ca.avif?t=1724774213\" width=800 height=100 /></span><br>You have 72 hours to deliver the cargo to your customers.<br>\u2022 Customers come to the cargo office. Dozens of cargoes accumulate during the day.<br>\u2022 There will also be cargoes coming from out of town.<br>\u2022 You have 72 hours, i.e. 3 days, to distribute all the cargoes.<br>\u2022 If you cannot deliver the cargo to the addresses in the requested time, you will be penalized.<br><br>Therefore, determine and distribute the cargoes that need to be distributed as a priority.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875640/extras/f9322b07a3399cb13de59e3cab7ef256.poster.avif?t=1724774213\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875640/extras/f9322b07a3399cb13de59e3cab7ef256.webm?t=1724774213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875640/extras/c120e21a7673e34e863b8e057d31e6ba.avif?t=1724774213\" width=800 height=100 /></span><br>There are many cargoes that need to be transported urgently. Haven't you chosen which vehicle to use yet? You can also carry cargo boxes on foot, but this can be a waste of time. Buy a bicycle, motorcycle or car and carry more cargo faster.<br><br>When you start the game, you have enough money to feed your hungry stomach.<br><br>Therefore, you will distribute cargo packages on foot.<br><br>As you earn money, buy bags to distribute more packages.<br><br>As you earn a little more money, you can buy a bicycle and move faster.<br><br>As you earn more money, you can buy yourself panel vans and establish a fleet. You can do more work by giving your vehicles to your employees. There are many more features like this. (This feature is not available in this version.)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875640/extras/2ae254e9581c0530a57588a4f4eb9a82.poster.avif?t=1724774213\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875640/extras/2ae254e9581c0530a57588a4f4eb9a82.webm?t=1724774213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875640/extras/30a2e928d8fb1473676301833b5de762.avif?t=1724774213\" width=800 height=100 /></span><br>Use the scale to deceive customers or be an honest deliveryman.<br>\u2022 You must weigh the packages of the incoming customers first.<br>\u2022 You must enter the weight of the package into the system.<br>\u2022 You must collect your money from the customer and then it is ready for delivery.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875640/extras/3b398f10a136dfcdccea1c0c49f63fb5.poster.avif?t=1724774213\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875640/extras/3b398f10a136dfcdccea1c0c49f63fb5.webm?t=1724774213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>You quit your job and moved to a city to be your own boss. Although the town is small, it is constantly growing. It is building new streets. The biggest problem of this happy and peaceful town is that there is no cargo company in the town. You can take advantage of this opportunity and develop and establish your own cargo company in this town that will become a city. Your goal is to be the only cargo company in this town.<br><br>Starting from a small warehouse to a large warehouse, establish your own cargo company!<br><br>You have many customers waiting in line. Don't keep your customers waiting in line, pay their bills quickly!<br><br>You quit your job and moved to a city to be your own boss. Although the town is small, it is constantly growing. It is building new streets. The biggest problem of this happy and peaceful town is that there is no cargo company in the town. You can also take advantage of this opportunity and develop and establish your own cargo company in this town that will become a city. Your goal is to be the only cargo company in this town.<br><br>Starting from a small warehouse to a large warehouse, establish your own cargo company!<br><br>You have many customers waiting in line. Don't keep your customers waiting in line, pay their bills quickly!",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875640/extras/493bf1ede58c2dbbd33c544c90c709ca.avif?t=1724774213\" width=800 height=100 /></span><br>You have 72 hours to deliver the cargo to your customers.<br>\u2022 Customers come to the cargo office. Dozens of cargoes accumulate during the day.<br>\u2022 There will also be cargoes coming from out of town.<br>\u2022 You have 72 hours, i.e. 3 days, to distribute all the cargoes.<br>\u2022 If you cannot deliver the cargo to the addresses in the requested time, you will be penalized.<br><br>Therefore, determine and distribute the cargoes that need to be distributed as a priority.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875640/extras/f9322b07a3399cb13de59e3cab7ef256.poster.avif?t=1724774213\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875640/extras/f9322b07a3399cb13de59e3cab7ef256.webm?t=1724774213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875640/extras/c120e21a7673e34e863b8e057d31e6ba.avif?t=1724774213\" width=800 height=100 /></span><br>There are many cargoes that need to be transported urgently. Haven't you chosen which vehicle to use yet? You can also carry cargo boxes on foot, but this can be a waste of time. Buy a bicycle, motorcycle or car and carry more cargo faster.<br><br>When you start the game, you have enough money to feed your hungry stomach.<br><br>Therefore, you will distribute cargo packages on foot.<br><br>As you earn money, buy bags to distribute more packages.<br><br>As you earn a little more money, you can buy a bicycle and move faster.<br><br>As you earn more money, you can buy yourself panel vans and establish a fleet. You can do more work by giving your vehicles to your employees. There are many more features like this. (This feature is not available in this version.)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875640/extras/2ae254e9581c0530a57588a4f4eb9a82.poster.avif?t=1724774213\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875640/extras/2ae254e9581c0530a57588a4f4eb9a82.webm?t=1724774213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875640/extras/30a2e928d8fb1473676301833b5de762.avif?t=1724774213\" width=800 height=100 /></span><br>Use the scale to deceive customers or be an honest deliveryman.<br>\u2022 You must weigh the packages of the incoming customers first.<br>\u2022 You must enter the weight of the package into the system.<br>\u2022 You must collect your money from the customer and then it is ready for delivery.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875640/extras/3b398f10a136dfcdccea1c0c49f63fb5.poster.avif?t=1724774213\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875640/extras/3b398f10a136dfcdccea1c0c49f63fb5.webm?t=1724774213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>You quit your job and moved to a city to be your own boss. Although the town is small, it is constantly growing. It is building new streets. The biggest problem of this happy and peaceful town is that there is no cargo company in the town. You can take advantage of this opportunity and develop and establish your own cargo company in this town that will become a city. Your goal is to be the only cargo company in this town.<br><br>Starting from a small warehouse to a large warehouse, establish your own cargo company!<br><br>You have many customers waiting in line. Don't keep your customers waiting in line, pay their bills quickly!<br><br>You quit your job and moved to a city to be your own boss. Although the town is small, it is constantly growing. It is building new streets. The biggest problem of this happy and peaceful town is that there is no cargo company in the town. You can also take advantage of this opportunity and develop and establish your own cargo company in this town that will become a city. Your goal is to be the only cargo company in this town.<br><br>Starting from a small warehouse to a large warehouse, establish your own cargo company!<br><br>You have many customers waiting in line. Don't keep your customers waiting in line, pay their bills quickly!",
